      "label": "Brain responses during Python reading",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "page": 1,
          "text": "The current study addressed this gap by recording \nelectrophysiological brain responses as 62 Python programmers with varying skill levels read lines of \ncode with manipulations of form (syntax) and meaning (semantics).",
