          "page": 3,
          "text": "This research was designed to answer two questions: (1) Do the P600 and N400 ERP components index \nsensitivity to form and meaning when programmers comprehend lines of code incrementally? and (2) Does \nsensitivity to form change as a function of programming proficiency?",
